-- WHOSE reads the FIRST word of each line, so a line that begins with NOT
-- has no field in the position the rule reads. WHO is the general form
-- (§13.6, RULED 2026-09-21).
IMPORT prelude

DECLARE Actor IS ONE OF
    Tenant HAS tname IS A STRING
               standing IS A STRING
DECLARE Action IS ONE OF
    Pay HAS payer IS AN Actor

alice MEANS Tenant WITH tname IS "Alice", standing IS "current"
everyone MEANS LIST alice

GIVETH A DEONTIC Actor Action
`a negation under WHOSE` MEANS
    EVERY Tenant t IN everyone
        WHOSE  NOT (standing EQUALS "current")
        MUST   Pay t
        WITHIN 7
        UPON EACH
        HENCE  FULFILLED
        LEST   BREACH
